&lt;p&gt;Product Manager — Order Fulfilment: own the roadmap and execution of the order fulfilment product portfolio within Mr D. This includes the customer journey from restaurant order acceptance through delivery, including order tracking, delivery timelines, late and delayed orders, restaurant handovers, driver assignments and delivery updates.This includes all verticals, customer journeys and success metrics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
