&lt;li&gt;On-demand platforms: An understanding of the unique challenges and opportunities in on-demand delivery, including real-time logistics, driver management, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution-oriented: Proactive, accountable, and motivated to solve complex problems in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven approach: Strong analytical skills with the ability to use data to inform decisions and measure success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical acumen: Familiarity with back-end systems, APIs, and technologies that support logistics execution, such as route optimization algorithms, real-time tracking, and trip allocation logic. Thorough knowledge of prevailing and emerging mobile and e-commerce trends and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder management: Exceptional organizational and communication skills to balance multiple priorities and align cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail: A meticulous approach to product development and the required documentation to support the successful assessment and execution of a detailed product initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer advocate: A strong focus on improving the experience for both drivers and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
