&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reporting to measure the success of projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong analytical and critical thinking, using data to inform decisions across the retail media product portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage advertising tool experience with platforms such as Google Analytics, Looker and other ad manager/server platforms and reporting/targeting tools to extract key insights and drive data-informed product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and maintain the accuracy of in-app analytics (in-app events) and customer data points, to ensure product data is reliable for targeting and conversion tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
