&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.takealot.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Takealot.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, South Africa’s leading online retailer, is looking for a highly talented&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Promotions and Merchandising Manager - Cross Border &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a young, dynamic, hyper-growth company looking for smart, creative, hard-working people with integrity to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think you’ve been challenged before? Think again!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Over 4 million happy shoppers shop online on takealot.com and 2.7 million on Mr D. Show them what you can do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn:&lt;/strong&gt; We work with the best of the best. Work alongside leaders and upskill in record time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow:&lt;/strong&gt; Expand your career in the fast-growing Takealot Group: Takealot.com and Mr D. We like to promote from within: Here&#39;s your chance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Promotions and Merchandising Manager is responsible for developing and executing a clear merchandising strategy for the Cross Border business unit. The role drives promotional share of GMV and promotional conversion rate optimisation, ensuring that Cross Border deals are sourced, vetted, positioned, and promoted effectively across the Takealot platform. This is a hands-on, commercially driven role that sits at the intersection of sales, marketing, and trade optimisation bridging the gap between seller deal supply and customer- facing merchandising to unlock GMV growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merchandising Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own the Cross Border merchandising strategy and promotional calendar, aligned to seasonal peaks, category priorities, and business unit GMV targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track promotional share of GMV as a core performance metric, with clear targets and improvement plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse promotional conversion rates across deal types, categories, and merchandising placements; identify and action opportunities to improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use platform data (pageviews, conversion, AISP, search trends, lead-time share) to inform deal selection and merchandising positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Sourcing &amp;amp; Vetting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source deals from Cross Border sellers and aggregator partners, building a pipeline of promotional inventory ahead of seasonal and campaign windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vet and qualify deals for margin contribution, product quality, compliance, and customer appeal before inclusion in promotions.&lt;/li&gt;
